{"id":"en_the-devil-who-sponsored-me","title":"The Devil Who Sponsored Me","titleEn":"The Devil Who Sponsored Me","description":"Lucia's father needs surgery, so she accepts an au pair position in Los Angeles. Richard, her charming sponsor, seems like the answer to her financial troubles. Once she is under his roof, however, the arrangement turns sinister: he confines her by locking the doors, seizes her passport, and uses her younger sister as leverage against her. What began as a way to pay for medical care becomes a trap she must find a way out of.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-devil-who-sponsored-me/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-devil-who-sponsored-me/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-devil-who-sponsored-me_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-devil-who-sponsored-me_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-devil-who-sponsored-me_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-devil-who-sponsored-me_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsf4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-devil-who-sponsored-me_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1